<div
  id="dropy-rewards-root"
  data-logged-in="{% if customer %}1{% else %}0{% endif %}"
  data-customer-name="{{ customer.first_name | escape }}"
  data-theme-color="{{ block.settings.theme_color }}"
  data-door-text="{{ block.settings.door_text | escape }}"
  data-door-style="{{ block.settings.door_style }}"
  data-welcome="{{ block.settings.welcome_text | escape }}"
  data-position="{{ block.settings.position }}"
  data-offset-desktop="{{ block.settings.offset_desktop | default: 20 }}"
  data-offset-mobile="{{ block.settings.offset_mobile | default: 88 }}"
  data-account-url="{{ routes.account_url }}"
></div>
<div id="dropy-exit-root" data-shop="{{ shop.permanent_domain }}" style="display:none"></div>

{%- liquid
  assign dropy_gift_cfg = shop.metafields.dropy.gift_config.value
  assign dropy_exit_cfg = shop.metafields.dropy.exit_config.value
  assign dropy_wish_cfg = shop.metafields.dropy.wishlist_config.value
  assign dropy_credit_fmt = ""
  if customer.store_credit_account.balance
    assign dropy_credit_fmt = customer.store_credit_account.balance | money_without_trailing_zeros
  endif
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  `credit.enabled` is the release flag: shop metafield dropy.credit_panel_enabled
  (boolean). Absent metafield -> nil -> false -> the widget keeps the LEGACY rewards
  panel. Set it true to flip the store-credit panel on with no deploy.

  `credit.checkoutEnabled` is a SECOND, independent flag:
  dropy.credit_checkout_enabled. It governs only the "use it at checkout" line. The
  panel can be live while redemption is still impossible — which is the case until
  Fastrr can apply store credit at their checkout. Do not merge the two flags.

  `credit.formatted` is the balance through money_without_trailing_zeros — the SAME
  filter snippets/dropy-store-credit.liquid uses for the header amount, so the panel
  and the header can never print two different styles of the same number. Assigned via
  a guarded variable so nil yields "" and this document always stays valid JSON.

  `credit.subunit` is customer.store_credit_account.balance — a money object whose RAW
  output is the balance in the currency subunit (paise for INR), NOT rupees. It is emitted
  as a JSON *string* on purpose, for two reasons:
    1. nil renders as "" which is still valid JSON, so a missing balance can never
       malform this document and take the gift / exit / wishlist config down with it;
    2. "" is meaningfully different from "0". The account returned is the one in the
       currency of the customer's CURRENT context, so a customer holding INR credit who
       browses a non-INR market gets nil, not zero. The widget must not print ₹0.00 there.
  Do not swap this for `| json` — the json filter serialises a money object as {}.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/json" id="dropy-widget-config">
{
  "gift": {% if dropy_gift_cfg %}{{ dropy_gift_cfg | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
  "exit": {% if dropy_exit_cfg %}{{ dropy_exit_cfg | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
  "wishlist": {% if dropy_wish_cfg %}{{ dropy_wish_cfg | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
  "credit": {
    "enabled": {% if shop.metafields.dropy.credit_panel_enabled.value %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
    "checkoutEnabled": {% if shop.metafields.dropy.credit_checkout_enabled.value %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
    "loggedIn": {% if customer %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
    "subunit": "{{ customer.store_credit_account.balance }}",
    "formatted": {{ dropy_credit_fmt | json }}
  }
}
</script>

{{ 'rewards-widget.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'rewards-widget.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Dropy Rewards Widget",
  "target": "body",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "color", "id": "theme_color", "label": "Theme color", "default": "#FB923C" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "welcome_text", "label": "Welcome text", "default": "Welcome back" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "door_text", "label": "Door text", "default": "Rewards" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "door_style", "label": "Door style",
      "options": [
        { "value": "icon", "label": "Icon" },
        { "value": "text", "label": "Text" },
        { "value": "icon_text", "label": "Icon and text" }
      ],
      "default": "icon_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "position", "label": "Position",
      "options": [
        { "value": "right", "label": "Bottom right" },
        { "value": "left", "label": "Bottom left" }
      ],
      "default": "right"
    },
    { "type": "range", "id": "offset_desktop", "label": "Bottom offset — desktop", "min": 0, "max": 200, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 20 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "offset_mobile", "label": "Bottom offset — mobile", "min": 0, "max": 200, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 88 }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}